<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Oroome</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Oroome Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oroome</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oro.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Oroome Asayis Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Phawuloosa kiitay Oroome asayis xaafintteezay, Phawuloosa Oroome gancce yez woosa keetha be7adayis qoppeez gishos E yhanigodar unttii giiginttii naagod garkk ododayisii. Phawuloosa qofay Oroome gancce yez ammanizitayira xiqqa wode ootheezaypp guye unttii eza maaddiko Isppeene yhammadayisii. Ammano bagga e ereezannee ammaniza asay ye timirtta oosol afa peeshshoday garkk qonccisii xaafeeza. Yha maxaafay gancce Phawuloosa kunth kiitay yha qofa aykkiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Oroome gancce yez ammaniza asita tiinatti sarothii maaqqii, kaallii unttis woossizana odeezaypp guye fa kiitayis baaso qofa, «Wongilayid Xoossa xillotithay bentteeza; ye xillotithay tiinap wurssithi hellodayis ammanor bentteeza» gi odiza (1:17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeyppi guye, ye qofa dalgisii xaafiza. Ayihudita maaqqin Ayihude baa asita maaqqin ubbitay nagaras moddintteezita maaqqeez gishos unttii Xoossar dabbotodayis koshshiza. Asay Xoossar dabbotodayis danda7izay Yesuus Kiristtoosana ammanora. Unttii Xoossar medhdhiza yha orothi pettipettith aafay, orothi yess maaqqeezana Phawuloosa dalggisii odiza. Ammaniza as Xoossar saro yeza; ma Xoossa Ayyana baggar nagarappennee yhayiqo wolqqapp kessii ekkiza. Shemppo 5-8 hellodayis Phawuloosa Xooss higgaynnee ammaniza as yessal oothiz Xooss Ayyana wolqqa qofay abizako odiza. Yeypp kaallii, Phawuloosa, «Xoossay as na7itayis qoppeez qofa gancce Ayihuditaynnee Ayihude baa asii wayizii wolla waaxinttodayis danda7ee?» yeegiz oychayis mahith immadayis butiteeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ma Ayihuditay Yesuusa ekkaam ixxeezay Xooss qofa maaqqeezana odiza. Yey haneezay Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar qoncciseez aadho keehetithay gancce as kochch ubbay ekkoday garkkee. Maaqqozin, Ayihuditay Yesuusa ekkod wode ye7odana Phawuloosa ammaniza. Wurssethal Phawuloosa ammanor wayizii yezodayis beezizako odiza. Xoossis ootho bagga, ammaniza asay fa biittasinne wol gancce pettay pettayis yez adetithar oothod bazinnee kaha baggar medhinttiza oyichchitay bagga paaddii odiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Oroome kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Oroome kiita kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">As na7as atotithii koshshiza baz <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18—3:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossii as ashshiza oge <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21—4:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosar benttiz orothi de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1—8:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isreeles Xooss qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1—11:36</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza as yessi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuste qofannee sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14—16:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa aylle maaqqeez, hawaare maaqqadayis xeegintteezayppennee Xoossa Wonggile sabbakod garkk shaakintteez Phawuloosa kiitteez kiita.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Xoossay gaame wodepp tiina fa nabitay baggar immada geez Xooss Wonggilay geeshsha Maxaafitayid xaafintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Ye Wonggilay ashor Dawute sheeshapp yelintteez, Xooss Na7a, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga odiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Ma E fa geeshsha Ayyanar yhayiqopp denddii, Xooss Na7a maaqqizana damma wolqqar beezeeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>E baggar Ayihude baazitay ubbitay, ammanii kiitinttod garkk Kiristtoosa sunthay gishos Xoossay aadho keehatithar hawaaretithi mawute nuus inggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosas maaqqad garkk xeegintteezitaypp baggitay yinttana.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Oroome gancce yez, Xoossay qaadhizitayssinnee e geeshsh woya maaqqad garkk maraxeezitayis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Xoossa nu Adayppennee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp aadho keehetithinnee sarotithay yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome asa be7adayis amotithii yeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Ubbapp tiinatii, yi ammanay biitta ubbayil sintteez gishos Yesuus Kiristtoos baggar yi gishos ta Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Taanii e Na7ay wonggilay bagga kunth wozinar odiza Xoossay, taanii ta woosayid ubba wode yinttan qoppizayis E markka. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Wurssithal, Xooss shene maaqqiko, taanii yinttiko yhammadayis ogay taasi ushachod garkk ubba wode woossiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Taanii yinttis Ayyana imotithi shagodayssinnee yinttan be7adayis laamotiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Yeykka, taanii yi ammanayir, ma yi ta ammanayir miinggoday garkk.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ta ishuntho, taanii Ayihude baa asaypp aafe denggeezay garkk, yinttapekka aafe denggodayis yinttiko yhammadayis qoppeeza, zin tana kayeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Haw. O. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Girike asayisnnee tamaarekka asayis ma ecitayisnnee boozitayis taas aco yeza.<verse eid="ROM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Yey gishos, Oroome gancce yez yinttiskka Wonggile ododayis ta amottiza.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonggile wolqqa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Wonggilayir yeelataam, tiinatii Ayihudita, ezaypp Grike asayis ammanizita ubba ashshodayis Wonggilay Xooss wolqqa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar. 8:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Xillo ammanor de7o yezoda ginttinttii xaafintteeza. Xooss xillotithay bentteeza; tiinapp aykkii wurssith hellodayis asii xillizay ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibr. 2:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iitatithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Tumay erinttaam garkk fa iita oosor kayiza asal afannee nagara ubbayil afa, Xooss seera salopp wodhdhiza. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Xoossay unttis benttodayis beeziza baz qoncciseez gishos unttii Xoossibaz eriza. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Alame medhintteezaypp aykkii, asis benttowa Xooss hanota, yeykka e medhina wolqqannee Xoossatithay e medhetithayir benttii yeza gishos asay fa iitatithis salambodibaz baaya.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Unttii Xoossa erttar, eza bonchchekayannee galatekkaya. U qofay maaddoowa baz maaqqeeza; u akaakowa wozinay dhumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efi. 4:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Unttii fana ecita giza, zin boozita. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Dhaboowa Xoossa goynnodana ashshii, yhayqqiz as medhettithar, kafitay medhettithar, do7itay medhettitharannee ulor goochinttiza bazita aazisii ootheez misilita goynneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Nam7i. 4:16-18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Yey gishos, unttii pettay pettayir borsso baz oothii, fa galla toochchod garkk Xoossay unttan u wozinay amottiz tuna oosos aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Yey haneezay unttii Xooss turotitha worddor laammeez gishonnee medhdheez Xoossa ashshii, medhetithii goynneez gishshos. Xoossay medhinas galatintteezaya. Amin7e.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Yey gishos, Xoossay unttan u borsso amottithayis aathii inggeeza. U maachchitay paas beeziza dhiirathar aqoda ashshii, beezoowa baz hanii maachchii maachchar wolla aqeeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Yey garkk, dhiirathitay paasi beeziza maachchar aqiza ashii, dhiirathi dhiirathar wola aqeeza. Dhiirathi pettay pettayir amotithar xuuginttii, borsso baz ootheeza. Fa ootheez buutayis beeziza pirdde ekkeeza.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Unttii Xoossa erodayis ixxeez gishos beezoowa baz oothod garkk Xoossay u kaha pathaam qofas aathii inggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Unttar zhucatithii, iitatithii, uuzatithii, gene, qinaate, shemppo wodho, palama, dooshanne iita amo kumeeza. Unttii zigirizita, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>as sunth iissizita, Xooss ixxizita, cazhizita, utirttizita, ceeqinttizita, iita baz oothodayis koyizitannee fa indisnnee fa adess kiitinttoozita, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>akaakozita, caaqo menthizita, siiqo baazita, qadhe baazita. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Yeyititay garkk oothizitayis yhayiqo beeziza giz Xoossa higge erittar, yhayitita oothiza. U paasi ooso aadda baazin oothiza yhankkitakka sabbiza.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss xillo pirdde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Yey gishos, neno hara asal afa pirddizayyo, neenii sankke shishizabaz baaya. Neenii hara asal afa pirddittar, ye ne pirddiza athay garkk oothiko, ne, neell afa pirddiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Mat. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luq. 6:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Yey garkk oothizitayil afa Xoossii xillo pirdda pirddiza nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Neno, yey garkk ooso oothizitayil afa pirddizayyo, unttii oothizanii garkk oothizayyo, neenii Xooss pirddapp attodbaz aazinee? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Woy Xooss keehetitha, garzhonnee danda7a duretitha ne leqqinee? Xoossii nees keeheezay nena nagarapp mahodayis maaqqizana eroosanee?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Zin yinttis minonnee maarotethi gelowa wozina yeza. Yey gishos, Xooss seeraynnee xillo pirdday benttiz gallas, neell afa pirdday kuurod garkk udiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Xoossay pettayis pettayis e oosat garkk immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Aazi. 24:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Lo77o oosor miinggii, galata, bonchchonnee dhaboowa de7o koyizitayis Xoossay medhina de7o immada. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Zin fana siiqizita, tuma ixxizitannee iita baz oothodayis koyizitayil afa Xooss seerannee gado ye7oda. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Iita baz oothiz as ubbita, tiinatii Ayihudita, ezaypp Grike asa metonnee un7a helloda. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Zin Xooss lo77o ooso oothiz ubbayis, tiinatii Ayihuditayis, kaallii Grikes galata, bonchchonnee sarotithi immada. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Xoossay as aafe bi7ii shaakkooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nam7i. 10:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Higge baa nagara ootheez ubbitay higge baa dhabod. Higge yezin, nagara ootheez ubbay higger pirddinttoda. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Xooss tiina xillizitay higge naagizitaypp attin higge sis aadda si7izita baaya. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Higge baa Ayihude baa asay medhor higge kiittiza oothiza. Unttisi higgay baa ixxikokka unttii fa wozinar higge eriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>U hanotay, higge kiitay u wozinayid xaafintteezana beeziza. Ma u kahay unttal afa markkattiza. U qofay pettii pettii toke unttal buuta gi mootiza; pettii pettii toke unttan luule giza. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Ta taamarsseez Wongile garkk Xoossay Yesuusa Kiristtoosa baggar as wozina gancce qosintteez qofa pirddiza wode yeyi erinttoda.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayihuditannee u higge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Zin ne nena Ayihude giza; higgel kattiza; Xoossar yez yessayid ne gayiriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Ne oothod garkk Xoossii koyiz baz abizako eriza. Higge tamaareez gishos tuma maaqqizbaz shagii eriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Neenii to7ita kaalithiza, ma dhuma yezitayis poo7o maaqqizana shaakkii eriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Neenii higgaypp denggeez eretithayirannee tumatithayir boozita erisizannee duudita taamarssiza maaqqizana eriza. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Yeezin, ne hara as tamaarssizay ne nena abis tamaarssoosa? Neenii, «Kassitipe» gi sabakkittar, neenii ne ubbas kasttinee? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Neenii, «Laammippe» giittar, neenii ne ubbas laamminee? Neenii eeqa ixxittar, eeqar yez kara bonqqinee? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Neenii Xooss higgayid ceeqinttiza, zin higgayis kiitinttaam ixxii Xoossa yeellathinnee? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Yi sankker Xoossa sunthay Ayihude baa asayir cazhinttiza» ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa. 59:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Ne higges kiittinttiko, ne dookalinttay adiza, zin neenii higges kiittinttaam ixxiko ne dookalintteekazay garkk maaqqiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ayihude maaqqekka as dookalinttekka yezar, higges kiittinttiko, Xoossay eza dookalintteezay garkk payidoosa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Yi, Ayihude asay, yinttis xaafintteez higgaynnee dookolinttii yezin, yi higges kiitinttaam ixxiko, Ayihude baa asay dookalinttaam ixxikoka higges kiitinttii, yinttal afa pirddoda.<verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Yikkee, sunthar Ayihude maaqqeez ubbitay tuma Ayihude baaya. Benttiz asho dookalinttay tuma dookalintto baaya. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Zin tuma Ayihudetith gancce baggar Ayihude maaqqiza. Tuma dookalinttay Xooss Ayyanar haniz wozina dookolinttopp attin xaafintteez higgayid haniz galla gacho baaya. Ye athay galata Xoossapp ekkizapp attin asapp baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Nam7i. 30:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayihuditay ammano ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Yeezin, Ayihudetithii ab maadee yenee? Woy dookalintto ab maadee yenee? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Tuma Ayihude maaqqithay gaame oger maaddiza. Ubbapp tiin Xoossay fa qaala hadara Ayihuditayis inggeeza.<verse eid="ROM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Yeezin, unttapp pettay pettay qaala ammanaam ixxiko, u ixay Xooss geeshshetitha kayinenee? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Kayooya! As ubbay worddo maaqqikokka Xoossay tuma maaqqo. Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Neqaalayir ne xilloda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">nena mootizana pirddar laththoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:4">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Maz. 51:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Yeezin, nu worzhay Xoossay geeshsha maaqqizana beeziza baz maaqqiko, nu waagodee? Xoossay nu nagara gishos nuul afa pirddiko, luulo baasanee? Yhaya taanii as qofa garkk giza. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Yeya baaya. Yey garkk haniko, Xoossii yha alamayil afa wayizii pirddode?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Zin ta worddotithay Xooss tuma qoncisii, e bonchcha dammisii beeziza baz maaqqiko, yeezin, abis taal afa nagaranchcho garkk pirddinee? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Pettii pettii asay, «Lo77o baz ye ye7od garkk iita oothiza» yeegii tamaarssizay garkk udii tana mootiza. Yey garkk asal yi7iza Xooss pirdday beezizaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillo pettakka Baaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Yeezin, nuunii waagodee? Nu aathonee? Yeya baaya! Ayihude maaqqin, Grike maaqqin ubbitay nagara oommo yezana taanii tiinatii yinttis odeeza.<verse eid="ROM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Xillo as pettakka baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Maz. 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Akakiza as baaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Xooss koyiz oonkka baaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Ubbitay balintteeza pettippe adoozita maaqqeeza haayotith oothizay baaya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Pettii askka baaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>U doonay dooyintteez duufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">fa iranthayir dooshshiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">U doonaypp,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">shooshii marze keziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Maz. 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>U doonayid camo odannee baadithii kumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Maz. 10:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>U tokay suuth laalodayis ellisiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa. 59:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>U ogayid dhabonnee daburssii yeza.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Unttii sarotith oge erooya.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Fa yessayid Xoossis yashittooya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:18">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Maz. 36:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>As ubba doona aythodayisnnee alama muumer Xooss pirddepp oommor shiishodayis, higge inggintteezay higgepp oommo aqizitayis maaqqeezana nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Yey gishos, oonkka higges kiitinttii Xooss tiina xillodayis danda7ooya. Higge as ubbitay nagaranchcho maaqqeezana beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz. 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal. 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotithi ammanora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Zin yhatti higgennee nabitay markatteez Xooss xillotithay higge baazin qoncceeza. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Yha xillotitha, Xooss Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammano baggar as ubbas shaako baazin inggiza.<verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Asii ubbay nagara ootheeza; Xoossii unttis inggeez bonchchaypp facceza. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Zin unttii Xooss aadho keehatithar, woziza Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggar cer xilleeza. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Xoossa Yesuus Kiristtoosa yarshsho udii inggeezay, eza ammaniza ubbitay e suuthayir nagara maarotith demmad garkke. Xoossay yeya ootheezay fa danda7ayir tiina nagara taybekka ashshii, fa xillotithi beezodayis. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Yha wodayid Yesuusa ammaniza ubba xillisor, Xoossay fa ubbas xillo maaqqeezana beeziza.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Yeezin, nu ceeqinttay aba yenee? Yeykka atteeza. Nuunii ceeqinttizay higges kiitinttiza gishonnee? Wa77a! Ammano higgerapp attin. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Xoossii as xillisizay ammanorapp attin higge naagor baazana nu eriza.<verse eid="ROM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Woy Xoossay Ayihuditayis aadda Xoossonee? Ayihude baazitayis Xooss baasannee? Tuma, Ayihude baazitayiskka E Xoosse. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Xooss petto; Ayihuditannee Ayihude baazitayissikka ammanor xillisizay eza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Nam7i. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Yeezin, nuunii higge ammano gishos shaaroda guussonnee? Yeya baaya! Higge minthodaypp attin.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Afraame ammanor xilleeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Yeezin, nu asho ade Afraame ab denggeennee? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Afraame oosor xilleezbaz maaqqeezako, E ceeqinttizabaz yeza, maaqqozin, Xooss tiina ceeqinttodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Geesha Maxaafay, «Afraame Xoossa ammaneeza; Xoossay yeya ezis xillotithi uddii ekkeeza» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medhe. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal. 3:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Oothiza athay ekkiza damoozay, e ooso wolqqas ciginttiza acopp attin ezis imota baaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Zin ooso oothowa oonkka nagaranchchana xillisiza Xoossa ammaniko, e ammanay ezis xillotith maaqqii payidinttiza. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Geesha Maxaafayid Dawute, ooso baazin Xoossii xillisiza athay ab garkk anjjintteezako yhay garkk yeegii qoncisii beeziza:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>«U buutay atto ginttinttizitaynnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">u nagaray ucintteezitay anjjintteezita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Maz. 32:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Goday e nagara payidekka asii anjjintteezaya»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 4:8">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Yeezin, Dawute odeez anjjo dookalintteez as aaddasonee? Woy dookalinttekka asi aaddasonee? Nuunii, «geesha Maxaafay, Afraame Xoossa ammaneeza; Xoossay yeya ezisi xillotithi udii ekkeeza yeegeeza». <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Yeezin, yey ayide hanee? Afraame dookalinttinennee? Woy dookalinttekka yezini? Dookalinttodaypp tiin haneezapp attin guye baaya.<verse eid="ROM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Afraame dookalinttodaypp tiina e ammanay ezis xillotithi maatame maaqqii payidintteezana erisodayis, e dookaloss malla maaqqeeza. Yey gishos, Afraame dookalinttekka ammanizitayisnnee ammanor xillizitayis ubbitayis ade maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe. 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>E dookalintteezitayssikka ade. Afiraame unttisi ade maaqqeezay unttii dookalintteez gishos aadda baazin E dookalinttodaypp tiin ammaneez ammana unttii kaalleez gishos.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss ufayssay ammanor ekinttiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Afraamesinnee e sheeshayis, «Alame ta yinttis immad» yeegeez ufayssay, Afraame ammanor xilleez gishossipp attin higge naagii poleez gishos baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Medhe. 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal. 3:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Higges kiitintteezitay Xoossay immad geez ufayssa ekkizita maaqqiko, as ammano cere; Xooss ufayssaykka shaarintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal. 3:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Higge mentho Xooss kach ki7iza, zin higge baa aqo higge menthokka baaya.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Yey gishos, Xoossii inggeez ufayssay ammanor ekinttiza. Yha ufayssay Afiraame sheesh ubbas Xooss aadho keehetithi baggar inggintteezana beeziza. Yeykka higge naagizitay aaddas baazin Afraame garkk ammaneez ubbitayis. Afraame nu ubbayis ade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gal. 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Geesha Maxaafayid, «Ta nena gaame woyitayis ade maheeza» ginttinttii Afraame gishos xaafintteeza. Yha ufayssay Afraames inggntteezay yhayqqeezitayis de7o inggizaynnee orothibaz oothiza Xoossay eza maaqqizana E ammaneez gishos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Medhe. 17:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Xoossay Afraames gaame zerith immadana caaqqeeza. Ufayssi oothodayis abkka danda7inttoowa wode Afraame Xoossa ammaneez gishonnee ufayis ootheez gishos gaame woyitayis ade maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medhe. 15:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Afraames xeet laythi kumod hanikokka, daabureez dhiirathettithannee Saara na7a yelodayis danda7ooza erttar fa ammanayir daaburekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Medhe. 17:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Maaqqozin, E fa ammanayir miinggii Xoossayis bonchcho inggeezapp attin Xoossay inggeez ufayssa ammanaam ixxii, sidhekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Afraame, Xoossay caaqqeez caaqa polodana fa kunth wozinar ammaneeza. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Yey gishos, Xoossii e ammana xillotith udii payideeza.<verse eid="ROM 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Zin, «Ezis xillotitha tayibeeza» giz qaalay Afraame aaddas xaafinttekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Ye qaalay nu Yesuusa yhayiqopp dentheez Xoossa ammaniza nuuskka nu ammano xillotithar taybinttoday garkk xaafintteezay <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>nu nagara gishos yhayiqos aathii inggeeza; E nuna xillisodayis yhayiqopp dendeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa. 53:4-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossar yez sarotith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Yikkee, nu ammanor xilleez gishos nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Xooss baggar nuus sarotithi aykkoda. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Nuunii e baggar yhatti nu eqqeez aadho keehetithay gancce ammanor geleeza. Yey gishos, nu Xoossay bonchcha shaakinttodayis yez ufayisayir ceeqinttiza.<verse eid="ROM 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Yey aadda baazin meto danda7a ki7izana nu eriza gishos nu meto ganccerakka ceeqinttiza. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Ma danda7a garzho, garzho ufayssi inggizana nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Nuusi inggeez geeshsha Ayyanay baggar Xoossay fa qadha nu wozina gancce gaddeez gishos ye ufayssay nuna yeellathooya.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Nuunii haga daabureezita maaqqii yezin, Xoossii wode hellin, Kiristtoosa nagara ootheezitay gishos yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Geesh as gishos yhayqqod as waayii demmada, zin keeha as gishos yhayqqod as oonii eree benttekka attaamii. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Zin nuunii haga nagaranchcho maaqqii yezin, Kiristtoosa nu gishos yhayqqeeza. Xoossay nuna ab garkk qadhdhizako e qadha beeziza. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Yikkee, nuunii Kiristtoosa suuthayir xilleezbaz maaqqiko, ubbaypp aathii e baggar Xooss seeraypp attoda. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Nuunii tiina Xoossar morkkita, zin e Na7ay yhayiqo baggar ezar igintteeza. Yeypp aathii, yhatt nuunii Xoossar dabboteez e na7ay de7o baggar nuunii attoda. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Yey aadda baazin yhatt nuna Xoossar dabbotheez nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar nu Xoossar ceeqinttiza.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Addaamannee Kiristtoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Zini pettii athay baggar nagara yha alama geleeza. Ye nagaray baggar yhayqqo ye7eeza. Asii ubbitay nagara ootheez gishos yhayiqo as kochch ubba helleeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Medhe. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Higge ingginttodaypp tiina alamel nagara yeza, zin higge baa wode nagara nagara maaqqii payidinttekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Zin Addaamepp Muse hellodayis yhayiqo as ubba mooddeeza. Hara attozin, Addaama garkk higges azazinttaa ixxii, nagara oothekkazitayis gujjikka yhayiqo kawuteeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Addaama ye7odayis yezayis aaziso. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Zin Xooss aadho keehatithay pettii athay nagaray garkk baaya. Pettii as nagara baggar gaame asay yhayqqeeza. Zin Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Xooss aadho keehetithay gaamitayis aadhii gaanggii inggintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Pettii athay nagaray ganccennee Xooss imotay gancce gaame dummatithii yeza. Pettii as nagara baggar Xoossii ezal afa pirddeeza. Zin asay gaame nagara oothikokka Xooss aadho keehetithay xillotith ke7eeza. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Pettii athay nagara baggar yhayiqo kawuteeza. Zin Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar puceez Xooss aadho keehetithinnee xillotith imota ekkiza ubbay, gamii de7or yezoda.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Yikkee, pettii asii nagara ootheez baggar as ubbayil afa pirdda ye7eezay garkk pettii asii xillo ootheez baggar, Xoossii as ubba xillisii de7o inggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Pettii asii kiitinttaam ixxeez baggar, gaame asay nagaranchcho maaqqeezay garkk pettii as kiitinttithar gaame asay geeshsh maaqqoda.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Asay nagara wolqqa erod garkk higge ye7eeza, zin nagara wolqqay gaanggeez wode Xooss aadho keehetithay aadhii gaanggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nagara yhayiqo wolqqar kawuteezay garkk Xooss aadho keehetithay xillotithi wolqqar kawutii, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar nuna medhinas de7oko kaalithiza.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagaras yhayqqii Kiristtoosar yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Yeezin, nuunii waagodee? Xooss aadho keehetithay gaaggoday garkk nagarara miinggii wolla yezodene? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Wa77a, nuunii nagaras yhayqqeezibaz maaqqiko, yeezin, nuunii yhaypp wayizii nagarara yezodee? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Nu ubbitay Yesuus Kiristtoosar petto maaqqadayis xammaqqinttii e yhayiqayid ezar petto maaqqadayis xammaqqintteezana eroosa? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Nu xammaqqintteez wode Kiristtoosar yhayqqii moogintteeza. Kiristtoosa Xooss Aday bonchcho wolqqar yhayiqopp dendeezay garkk nuukka orothi yess yezoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Qol. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Nu e yhayiqayid ezar petto maaqqiko, yey garkkekka, e denddayid ezar wolla petto maaqqada. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Nu yhaypp guye nagaras aylle maaqqaam garkkennee nu nagaranchcho asho wolqqay dhabod garkk nu cima asetithay Kiristtoosar sottintteezana eriza. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Pettii as yhayqqiz baz maaqqiko, E nagara wolqqapp wozinttii keziza. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosar yhayqqiko, ezar de7o yezodana ammaniza. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp dendeez gishos maaqqii E yhayqqaamizannee yhayiqo tiinapp eza mooddamizana nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>E Yhayqqeez wode pettii toke wurssii yhayqqeeza, zin yhatti de7o Xoossis yeziza. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Yey garkkekka, yi nagaras yhayqqii, Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Xoossis de7o yezana qoppoytta.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Yey gishos, yinttii, yi asho innas kiitinttaam garkk yhayqqiz yi ashayil nagara kawuttippe. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Ma yi aba asetith kiffle nagara oothodayis worzhe miishe uddii inggippatte. Zin yi yhayiqopp denddii, de7o yeza as garkk yi asho Xoossis inggoytta. Ma yi kunthi asho geeshsha ooso miishe udii Xoossis aathii inggoytta. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Yi Xooss aadho keehetithay oommor yezapp attin higgepp oommor baa gishos nagara yinttan moododayis beezooya.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotithis aylle maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Yeezin, nu waagodee? Higgepp oommor baazin Xooss aadho keehetithay oommor yeza gishos nagara wolla oothonnee? Wa77a! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Yi kiitinttodayis yinttan aylle udii inggiz wode ye yi kiitinttizayis aylle maaqqizana yi eriza. Yey garkkekka, yi nagaras kiitinttiko, yinttis yhayiqo ki7iz nagaras aylle maaqqiza. Woy yi Xoossis kiitinttiko xillotith ki7iz Xoossayis aylle maaqqiza. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Kase yi nagaras aylle, zin yhatti yi yinttan aathii inggeez tuma timirttayis kunthi wozinapp kiitintteez gishos Xoossis galata maaqqo. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Yi nagara aylletith achchapp bilinttii xillotith aylle maaqqiza.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Yinttii yi qofar daabura maaqqeez gishos taanii ooskka geliza oger odiza. Kase yinttii, yi asetith kifle ubba tunannee iita baz oothodayis aylle udii inggeezay garkk yhatt yi asetith kifle ubba geeshsh maaqqad garkk xillotithi aylle udii inggoytta.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Yi nagaras ayllettii yeza wode xillotithis haakor yeza. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Yinttan yhatt yeellathiza biin yi iita oosaypp aba aafe denggeennee? Yeyis wurssithay yhayiqo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Zin yi nagara aylletith achchapp bilinttii, Xoossis aylle maaqqiza. Yey yinttan xillo aafe aafisiza e wursithay medhina de7o. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Nagaras damoozay yhayiqo. Zin Xoossay, nu Goda Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggar ingginttizay medhina de7o.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekonnee gelo aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ta ishuntho, taanii odizay higge eriza asayisii. Higge pettii asii pathi yeza wode ubba eza mooddiza. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Aazisos, azin geleez astta I azinay pathi yeza wode higger ezar accintteeza. Zin I azinay yhayqqiko ezar iza caaqqeez caaqay izo mooddooya. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Yey gishos, iza fa azinay pathi yezin, hara dhiirathi geliko, iza laammeezanno ginttittiza. Zin I azinay yhayqqiko, caaqay izo mooddoowa gishos iza hara azin geliko, iza laammeezanno giinttinttoya.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Yey gishos, ta ishuntho, yi Kiristtoosa asho baggar higge wolqqas yhayqqii, Xoossis aafe aafodayis yhayiqopp denddeez Kiristtoosas maaqqiza. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Nu asho amo nuna mooddin, nu yezayir higge gujjii nagara oothod garkk nuna denthithiza. Nu asho gancce iita amotithii yeza gishos nuunii yhayiqo aafe aafod garkk ootheeza. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Zin yhatt nuunii nuna acceez higgayis yhayqqeez gishos nuunii higge achchapp bilintteeza. Yey gishos, orothiza Ayyana ogel Xoossis kiitinttizapp attin xaafintteez cima higges kiitinttaamii.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgennee nagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Yeezin, nu waagodee? Higge nagaranee? Wa77a! Zin higge nagara abizako tana eriseeza. Higge, «Amottippe» goozako, amotithii abizako ta eroozinii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kes. 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Nam7i. 5:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Zin ta ubba baz amottod garkk nagara higge baggar taal oge denggeeza. Higge baazako nagara yhayqqeeza.<verse eid="ROM 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Kase higge baa wode ta pathi, zin higge inggintteez wode nagara paxxin ta ma yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Taanii de7or yezod garkk Xoossay inggeez higgay taass yhayiqo ke7eeza. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Nagara higge baggar tana dooshiza oge denggii, wodheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Medhe. 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Yey gishos, higge geeshshii; ezar xaafintteez kiitaykka geeshshii, xillonnee lo77o.<verse eid="ROM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Yeezin, lo77o maaqqeez baz taal afa yhayiqo ke7eenennee? Wa77a! Zin nagara nagara maaqqizay benttod garkk lo77o bazar maaddinttii taass yhayiqo ke7eeza. Yey gishos, nagara nagaratithay higge baggar aadhii erintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Nuunii higge ayyana baz maaqqizana eriza. Zin taanii nagaras bayizintteez asho asii. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Taanii oothizabaz akaakooya; taanii dosizbaz oothodana ashshii ta ixxizabaz oothiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal. 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Ta ixxizabaz oothizabaz maaqqiko, higge lo77o maaqqizana ta ma77iza. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Yeya maaqqiko, ye oosa taar yeza nagaray oothizapp attin ta oothooya.<verse eid="ROM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Taar, yeyikka ta ashor lo77o baz baazana ta eriza. Lo77o baz oothiza amotithii taar yeza, zin lo77o baz oothodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Taanii ixxiza iitta baz oothizapp attin ta qaadhiza lo77o ootha baaya. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Taanii ixxizabaz oothizabaz maaqqiko, yeya taar yeza nagaray oothizapp attin oothizay tana baaya.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Yikkee, ta lo77o baz oothodayis dosodar, iitta baz ooso higge maaqqizana denggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Taanii ta wozinar Xooss higgayid ufayttiza. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Zin ta asho gancce yeza ta kaha higger olinttiza duma higge bi7iza. Ye higgay ta asho gancce oothiza nagara higges tana di77i aylle udeeza. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Taanii wayizii sonqqeez aso? Yhayiqos kanggiz yha asetithaypp tana ashshoday oonoo? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Xoossis galata maaqqo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Yikkee, taanii ta qofar Xooss higges mooddintteeza; zin ta ashayir nagara higges mooddintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Ayyanar yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Yey gishos, Kiristtoos Yesuusar yezitayis yhatt pirdda baaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggar nuus de7o inggiz Geeshsha Ayyana higgay, tana nagaranne yhayiqo higge aylletithapp kesseeza. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Nu nagara ashay baggar, higgay daabureez maaqqeez gishos nuna ashshodayis danda7ekkaya. Xoossay fa na7a nagaranchcho as aazisor nagaras yarshsho maaqqad garkk kiittii yeya ootheeza. Yeezii, Xoossay Kiristtoosa ashay baggar nagara, nagaranchcho as gancce pirddeeza. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Xoossay yeya ootheezay, nu asho amo koyizay garkk baazin Geeshsha Ayyanay koyizay garkk yeza nuul afa higge geesh kiitay polinttod garkke.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Fa asho amo garkk yezitay fana ufayssiz abaz qoppiza. Zin geeshsha Ayyana shene garkk yezitay geeshsha Ayyana baz qoppiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Asho qofay yhayiqo, zin ayyana bagga qopo de7onnee sarotithii. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Asho bagga qofa Xooss kantta morkkintto Xooss higges kiitinttooya kiitinttodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Fa asho amos moodinttizitay Xooss ufayssodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Zin Xooss Ayyanay yinttar yezikonnee yinttan mooddiko, yi Ayyana shener yezapp attin asho amos moodinttenna. Kiristtoosa Ayyanay baa oonkka Kiristtoosa baz baaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Zin Kiristtoosa yinttar yeziko, yi ashay nagara baggar yhayqqeeza. Zin yi ayyanay xillotithi baggar de7o yeza. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Zin Yesuusana yhayiqopp dentheez Xooss Ayyanay yinttar yeziko, Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp dentheez Xoossay, yinttar yez fa Geeshsha Ayyanayir yhayqqiz yi ashayis de7o immada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Qor. 3:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Yikkee, ta ishuntho, nuul aco yeza nu asho shenes yezodayis nu ashos baaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Yinttii, yi asho amos yeziko yhayqqodayis yeza, zin geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar nagara ooso wodhiko yi de7or yezoda. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Xoossa Ayyanay kaalithiza ubbay Xoossis na7ita. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Nuunii, «Aabbo, Adayyo» yeegii xeegiz, Xoossis na7ita udiza geeshsha Ayyana ekkeezaypp attin maaqqii yashshar yezodayis aylle udiz ayyana ekkekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gal. 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Xooss Ayyanay nu ayyanayir maaqqii nu Xoossis na7ita maaqqiza markattiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Nuunii e na7ita maaqqiko Xoossa laattizita; Kiristtoosar wolla yeya laattoda. Ma nuunii Kiristtoosar meto ekkiko ezar wolla e bonchcha shaakinttoda.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye7od bonchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Nuunii yhatt waayinttiza waaya, tiinapp nuus benttod bonchchayir wolihelthi be7adar, abikka aazii benttoza ta qoppiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Medhetithii ubbitay Xooss na7itay qonciitha gaame laamothar naagiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Medhetithii ubbitay cere bazis moodintteeza; yeykka, medhetithii dooror baazin ufayssis moodinttod garkk ootheez Xooss shener haneeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Medhe. 3:17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Medhetithay fa ommar dhabisiza aylletithipp wozinttii, Xooss na7itayir wolla bonchcho wozo shaakinttoda. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Medhetithay ubbay yhanno hellodayis iqithii aykkeez maachch garkk oolerannee metor yezana nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Ma medhetith aadda baazin Geesha Ayyana bayra imota garkk ekkeez nuunii, nu ubbas nu ashayis wozo maaqqeez Xooss na7ita maaqqad ufayss naagttar nu ashayir oolliza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 Qor. 5:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Yha ufayssayir nuunii paxeeza. Zin nuunii ufayss oothizabazay benttiz maaqqiko yeya oonii ufayss udee? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Zin nu be7ekka baz demmada gi ufayssar naagiko yeya danda7ar naagiza.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Yey garkk Geesha Ayyanay nu daaburssa maaddiza. Nuunii Xoossa wayizii woossodayis beezizako erooya, zin Ayyanay fa ubbas, asii ododayis danda7inttoowa qaalar nuus gaanatiza. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Ma as wozina eriza Xoossay, Geesha Ayyana qofay abizako eriza. Geesha Ayyanay Xooss shenay garkk geeshshitayis gaanatiza.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Xoossa qadhdhizitaysinnee e shenay garkk xeegintteezitayis Xoossay ubba baz lo77os oothizana nu eriza. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Xoossay tiinattii ereezita fa Na7a aazod garkkera na7aykka gaame ishitay ammanizitay gancce bayra maaqqad garkk unttan dummassii gaddeeza. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Xoossay tiinattii qoppii gaddeezita xeegeeza; xeegeezita xilliseeza; xilliseezita ma bonchcheeza.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Yeezin, nu yha ubbayis waagodee? Xoossay nu bagga maaqqiko nuuri oonoo eqinttoday? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>E hara attozin, fa na7ayis qadhdhekazar, nu gishos aathii inggeeza. Yeezin, fa gazza na7a nuus aathii inggeezay wayizii ubba baz cer inggaamo?<verse eid="ROM 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Xoossii dooreezita mootoday oonoo? Xillisizay Xoosse yeezin pirddoday oonoo? <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Yhayqqeezay yhayiqoppekka denddii Xooss ushachcha betteez, Kiristtoos Yesuusa, E nuus gaanatiza.<verse eid="ROM 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Yikkee, nuna Kiristtoosa siiqopp shaakkoday oonoo? Metone woy waayenee woy bayi7ithonee woy nayenee woy kallotithonee woy yashshanee woy olanee? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Geesha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Nu ne gishos ubba gallas butinttiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">shukinttiza duritay garkkekka taybintteeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:2">Maz. 44:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 8:36">ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Zin nu yha ubbayid nuna qadhdheez Kiristtoosar gamiz ubbitaypp aadhiza.<verse eid="ROM 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Yey gishos, yhayiqo maaqqin yess maaqqin kiitanchchita maaqqin moddizita maaqqin yhatt yezana maaqqin tiinapp ye7oda maaqqin wolqqamita maaqqin, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>Dhoqekka maaqqin ziqqekka maaqqin aba medhetithi maaqqin nu Goda, Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yeza Xooss siiqayipp nuna shaakkodayis danda7oozana taanii eriza.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isreelitay doorintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Taanii Kiristtoosar maaqqii turo odiza, worddotooya. Geeshsha Ayyanay kaalithiza ta kahay taanii worddotoozana taas markkattiza. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Ta wozinar Isra7eelitayis gaame qofarannee duuxoowa un7ara qamma gallas ta qoppiza. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Taanii, taas ashor dabo maaqqeez ta ishitay gishos Kiristtoosapp shaakinttii Xooss baadith gancce yezeezako dosizazin. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Unttii Isra7eelita, Xoossay unttan fa na7ita udeeza, fa bonchcha unttis qoncce odeeza. Unttar caaqqeeza; higge unttis inggeeza. U Xoossa goynnod tuma oga beezeeza; Xoossay ufayis qaala unttis inggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Kes. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>U yeletithayid mayzitay kochch; ma Kiristtoosa ashor kochche maaqqii ye7eeza. Ubbaypp aadho maaqqeez Xoossay medhinas galatintto. Amin7e!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Maaqqozin, Xoossa qaalay polinttekka atteeza guus baaya. Isra7eelepp yelintteez as ubbitay Isra7eele baaya. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Ma Afraame zare ubbitay Afraame na7ita baaya. Xoossay Afraames, «Ne sheeshay Isaaqa baggar xeeginttoda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe. 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Yeya guussay ashor yelintteez na7itay ubbitay Xooss na7ita baaya. Zin tuma Isra7eele na7itay Xoossay geleez qaalay garkk yelintteez na7ita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medhe. 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Inggoda gi geleez qaalay, «Taanii layth wode yhannode ye7oda; Saarakka dhiirathi na7a yeloda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Medhe. 18:10</ref></char></note> yeegintteezanno.<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Yey aadda baazin Irbiqa ma pettii nu ada Isaaqar aqi wodexeez wode. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Mentte na7itay yelinttodaypp woy iita woy lo77o udekkazin xeegizaypp attin oosopp baazin dooro Xooss qofay miinggoday garkke <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>«Bayray geedayis haarinttoda» yeegii Goday iis odeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Medhe. 25:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Yeykka Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Yayqqooba dosii, Eesawe ta ixxeeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mil. 1:2</ref></char></note> ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Yeezin, nuunii waagodee? Xoossay ase asapp qurinee? Xoossii quriza godayiss nu danda7ooya! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Goday Museko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">«Ta maarodayis koyeezitana maaroda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">ta qadhinttodayis koyizayis qadhinttoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kes. 33:19</ref></char></note> yeegeeza. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Yikkee, Xooss dooro as shener woy as oosor baazin e maarotithayira.<verse eid="ROM 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Geesha Maxaafayid, Gibxxe kaatayiko, «Taanii, ta wolqqa neell beezodaysinnee ta sunthay alame ubbayil erinttod garkk yeyis nena kawutiseeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kes. 9:16</ref></char></note> ginttinttii xaafintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Yikkee, Xoossay maarodayis koyizana maariza; wozina muumisodayis koyizay wozina muumisiza.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss kachchinnee maarotith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Yinttipp pettay, «Yeezin, Xoossay as abis boree? Xooss ixxizay oonoo?» yeegii oycodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="ROM 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Zin neno aso, Xoossar palamodayis ne oonoo? Ooso fana ootheezayiko, «Tana yhay garkk udii abis ootheenee?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa. 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></note> gi oycodayis danda7inee? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Woy urqqa medhdheezay pettii urqqapp petta bonchcho miishe, yhankka ma tooshe miishe udii medhdhodayis mawute baasannee?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Xoossay fa seera beezodayisinnee fa wolqqa ersodayis koy dhabos giigsseez seera miishshita gaame garzhor danda7eezako ab eree? <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>E yeya ootheezay damma bonchos giigiseez, fa dooreez na7itayis fa bonchcha ersodayisii. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Ayihude maaqqin, woy Ayihude baa as ubbita Xoossii dooreeza.<verse eid="ROM 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Nabe Hosa7e maxaafay gancce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Ta woya baazitakka, ‹Ta woya› gi xeegoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Dosinttekka woyitakka, ‹dosintteezita› gi xeegoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hosa. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Unttii ‹Ta woya baaya› ginttinttii xeegintteez aqayid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‹De7o Xooss na7ita› ginttinttii xeeginttoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hosa. 1:10</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Nabe Isiyaasa Isreele as baz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">«Isreele as abba shafe garkk gaanggikokka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">unttapp xiqqa as aadda attoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Isa. 10:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Goday biitta ubbayil afa ellis murttii ukker yhaya udoda.» <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Maakka Isiyaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Ubbapp Wolqqama Goday nuus xiqqa zerith ashshekkazako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">nuunii Soodomannee Gamoora katama garkk dhabodazin»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa. 1:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">yeegii tiinattii odeeza.<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Yeezin, nu waagodee? Xillotith koyibe7ekka Ayihude baa asay ammanor xillotithi denggeeza. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Zin xillotithayiko helthiz higge yeza Isreele asay xillotithi denggekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Abis denggekkasa? Unttii xillotith ammanor baazin oosor ekkodayis kozheez gishos. Yey gishos, unttii, «Dhubbiza shuchchar» dhubintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Bo7oytta taanii Xiyone dhube shuchchinnee fokkisiz zaalla gaddoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Eza ammaniza oonkka yeellatenna»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ta ishuntho, ta kunthi wozinar ta amottizaynnee Xoossa woossizay Isreelitay attod garkke. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Unttii Xoossis micinttizazin, tuma eretith dhabor micinttoozana ta markkattiza. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Unttii Xooss xillotith oge eraam ixxii, fa aadda xillotith kaalleezapp attin Xooss xillotith koyekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>As ubbay ammanor xillod garkk Kiristtoosa higges folo maaqqeeza.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotithii ubbitayisii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Muse asii higge naagii ekkiz xillotithibaz, «Higge naagiz oonkka ye higga naageezay garkk de7o yezoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewii. 18:5</ref></char></note> yeegeeza. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Zin ammanor ekkiz xillotith bagga giinttintteezay yhaya: «Ne wozinar, ‹Oonii salo kezode?» yeegippe; yey Kiristtoosa wothodayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Nam7i. 30:12-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Woy, «Sulle sa7a oommo wodhdhoday oonoo?» giippe; yey Kiristtoosa duufopp kessodayis. <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Zin yeegii xaafintteez: «Qaalay ne kale yeza; ne doona ganccennee ne wozina gancce yeza» Nuunii yinttis odiz ammano qaalay yhaya.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>«Yesuusa Goda» gi ne doonar markkatikonnee Xoossay eza yhayiqopp dentheezana ne wozinar ammaniko, ne attoda. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Asii fa wozinar ammanii xilliza; fa doonar markkattii attiza. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Maxaafay, «Eza ammaniza oonkka yeellattenna»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note> yeegeeza. <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Pettii Xoossay ubbitay Goda maaqqeez gishos Ayihuditay ganccennee Ayihude baa as gancce dummatithii baaya. E fana xeegiz ubbayis gaame keeha. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Goda sunth xeegiz oonkka attoda.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Yeezin, unttii ammanekka yezttar wayizii eza xeegodayis danda7ee? U ebaz si7ekka yezttar wayizii eza ammanodayis danda7inee? Ma unttis qaala odiz as baazin, wayizii si7odayis danda7inee? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kiitintteez asii baazin qaalay wayizii odinttodayis danda7ee? Maxaafayid, «Ufayss wonggile odiz asis tokitay waafa lo77ineshsha»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa. 52:7</ref></char></note> yeegii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Zin Isiyaasa, «Godayyo, nu markkatith oonii ammaneenee?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref></char></note> yeegeezay garkk, ubbitay wonggile ammanekkaya. <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Yey gishos, ammanay sisapp yi7iza; sissi Kiristtoosa qaalapp yi7iza.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Maaqqozin, u Qaala si7ibe7ekka guussonnee? Wa77a si7eeza. Maxsaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«U oday biitta ubbayil sintteeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">u qaalay sa7a gaxa helleeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Maz. 19:4</ref></char></note> yeegintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Zin Isreele asay erekkaya guussonnee? Muse tiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Taanii yinttan leqqintteez asay gancce qiirisoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ma akaakowa asay gancce yinttan yilosoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Nam7i. 32:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:19">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Ma Isiyaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Tana koyekka asayis ta bentteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">tana oyccekka asayis ta tana beezeeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa. 65:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:20">yeegii yashittekkazar odeeza.<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Zin Isayaasa Isreelitay bagga odittar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Gallas muda kiitinttoowa asaayssinnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">tana ixxiza asayis ta kushe miicceeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa. 65:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:21">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Isra7eelita olii ashshekkaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>An ta oyciza: yeezin, Xoossay fa woya olii ashshenenee? Ashshekkaya! Taanii ta ubbas Isreele; Afraame sheeshii; Biinama kochche.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Xoossay tiin dooreeza asita olooya. Maxaafayid, Eelaasa Isra7eelita Xooss tiina wayizii mooteezako, yi eroosanee? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>Eelaasa, «Godayyo, unttii ne nabita wodheeza, ne yarshsho aqakka laaleeza. Ta ta aaddas atteeza; unttii tanakka wodhodayis koyiza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Kaat. 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Xoossay eeko waagii maheene? «Ba7aale giz eeqas goynnekka laappun mukule asii taasi ashsheeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Kaat. 19:18</ref></char></note> yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Yey garkkekka, yha wodayid Xoossay fa aadho keehatithar maraxeez xiqqa xiqqitay [isreele] yeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>E unttan dooreezay fa aadho keehetithayirapp attin u oosor baaya. Dooray oosor maaqqiko, e aadho keehetithay cere atteeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Yeezin, waayenee? Isreelitay fa koyiz baz denggekkaya, zin Xoossii dooreez xiqqitay denggeeza. Atteezitay fa wozina muumiseeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Yeykka, Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«U aafey be7aamay garkk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">u hayay si7aamay garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">yhanno hellodayis unttis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">Xoossay azaalla ayyana inggeeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Nam7i. 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa. 29:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:8">ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk haneeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Ma Dawute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«U miiz leematay unttan xikennee olla aykko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">unttan gol7isiza gaga maaqqo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">u iitatithay unttan hello.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Maz. 69:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>U be7ekkazay garkk u aafay aykkintto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ubba wode meto unttan kuuniso» yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Yeezin, Dhubintteezitay pokkod garkkennee? Yeya baaya! U wodhithay Ayihude baa asay attod garkk sankke maaqqeeza. Yeykka Ayihuditay unttal afa qinaatamay garkk udeeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Ayihuditay nagaray alamayis gaame anjjo ke7eeza; ma u gaminttithay Ayihude baa asayis gaame anjjo maaqqeeza. Yeezin, doorintteez Ayihuditay kunthi attiz wode anjjo ab garkk darodeshsha?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Taanii, yinttis Ayihude baa asayis odiza. Ayihude baa asayis hawaare maaqqii oothizayira taanii gaame ceeqinttiza. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Ta yeya ootheezay taass asho dabbo maaqqeez Isreelitay qiirssi unttapp xiqqita ashshodayisii. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Xoossay unttan olii ashsheez wode yha alamay Xoossar dabbotteeza. Xoossay unttan shiishii ekkiza wode yhayqqeez asii yhayqqopp denday ab garkk maaqqodayis danda7ee?<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Tiina oleez munuqay lo77o maaqqiko yhankkaykka geeshshii. Mithis xapho geeshshii maaqqiko, shaqaykka geeshshii maaqqiza. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Gade tukkeez woyira shaqo karinttin, yinttii wora doleez woyira shaqo maaqqeezitay u aqaydd dhanthisinttii xaphor keziz zayite shaakintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Yikkee, yinttii shaqogarkk karinttii wodhdheezayil afa utirttippate. Yi utirttizabaz maaqqiko, xaphay yinttan tookkeezapp attin yi xapha tookkekkaza akaakoytta.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Neenii, «Ye shaqitay karintteezay, tanii u aqayid dhandinttodaygarkke» yi godayis danda7iza. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Yeyi tuma. Unttii ammanaam ixxeez gishos karintteeza. Neenii ammaneez gishos ye aqayid eqqeeza. Ne yashittodayis beezizap attin utirttodayis beezooya. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Xoossay medhintto shaqo maaqqeez Ayihuditayis qadhinttaam ixxiko yinttisikka qadhdhenna.<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Yikkee, Xoossii ab garkk keehazakonnee ab garkk minithizako bo7oytta. E minthatithay fokkeezitayis, ma E keehizay yinttisii. Miinggii eqqaam ixxiko yinttikka gachinttoda. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Unttii ammaniko, tiin fa yeza aqa maaqqoda. Xoossay wolqqama unttan mahii, gaddodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Yinttan wora yezi woyira maaqqeezita gachchii, karacha tukintteez woyirayil afa yinttan tukkiko, medhintto gade woyira maaqqeezita tiina aqayid mahii tukkodayis wayizii danda7inttoosa? <figure style="fig" alt="Olive tree with its fruits" file="BK00119B.tif" size="span" ref="11:24">Woyra mithinnee I aafe </figure><verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa maarotithay ubbitayisii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ta ishuntho, yi yinttan era gi gaayirppate. Ta yinttis odiza pettii xuurod baz yeza. Yeykka Isra7eelitaypp baggitay wozina miinthii si7aam ixxeezay wurssithii hellodayis baazin attodayis yez Ayihude baa asitay ubbay kunthar Xoossiko ye7oday garkke. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Yey garke, Isreele asitay ubbitay attoda. Maxaafayid:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«Nuna wozizay Xiyoonepp ye7oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Yayqqooba zerithapp iita ubba dhabisoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Isa. 59:20-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Taanii u nagara atto gizay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">unttar caaqqod caaqay yhaya»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Isa. 27:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:27">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Wonggile ekkaam ixxii, yi gishos morkke maaqqeeza. Maaqqozin, yhattekka unttii doorintteezita, Xoossii u aditay gishos unttan qaadheeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Xoossii fa imayraannee fa xeessayir qiirattoya. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Yinttii tiin Xoossayis kiittinttekka. Zin yhatt Ayihuditay kiitinttaam ixxin, yi Xooss maarotith ekkeezita. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Yey garkke, yi ekkeez maarotitha Ayihuditay ekkod garkk u yhatt Xoossis kiitinttaam ixxeeza. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Xoossii as ubbita fa maarotitha beezodayis koy, asii ubbitay kiitinttaam ixxoday garkk gorddeeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Xooss duretitha, eccetithannee eretitha akaakii ododay oonoo? E pirdday pilaginttooya, e ogay erinttooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa. 55:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Xooss kaha erizay oonoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Eza zorodayis danda7izay oonoo?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Xoossis tali7izaynnee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">tali7e mahii ekkizay oonoo?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Iyo. 41:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:35">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ubbay eep; ezarannee eesii; Ees medhinas bonchcho maaqqo. Amin7e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Qor. 8:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar orothi yessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Yikkee, ta ishuntho, yinttii, yi asetitha Xooss ufayssiza, pathinnee geeshsha yarshsho udii, immad garkk ta yinttan Xooss kehatithayir woossiza. Xoossa yi goynnodayis beeziza tuma ogay yeya. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Lo77o, ufayssizannee folo maaqqeez Xoossa kiita yi shaakkii erodayis yi qofar laaminttoyttapp attin yha alama aazippate.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Xoossii yinttis pettayis pettayis inggeez ammanay garkk kahar yez asi garkk qoppoytta. Qoppodayis beezizaypp aathii yinttan dummasii, utirar qoppipate gi taas inggintteez aadho keehatithayir yinttis odiza. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Nu pettii asetithayil afa duma duma kifilitay yeza; ye duma duma kifilitayis duma duma ooso yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1 Qor. 12:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Yey garkk, nuunii gaame as maaqqikokka Kiristtoosar pettii asho maaqqeeza. Nuunii pettii asho maaqqii duma duma kifilitay pettay pettayira aykintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Nuus inggintteez aadho keehatithar duma duma imotitay yeza. Nu imotithay tinbbite odo maaqqiko, nuus yez ammanay garkk ododayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1 Qor. 12:4-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Nu imotithay hara as maadee maaqqiko, ye oosayir minggodayis beeziza; taamarsso maaqqiko, ye tamaarssayir minggodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Nu imotithay hara as zorith maaqqiko, miinggii zorodayis beeziza. Nu imay nuuss yeza bazapp hara asis imo maaqqiko, wozinapp inggodayis beeziza. Nu imay aqiso maaqqiko, miinggii aqisodayis beeziza. Nu imay hara asis keehith maaqqiko, ufayisar keehodayis beeziza. Nu imay maaro maaqqiko ufayisar maarodayis beeziza.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Yi siiqqay qoodhepp qommo maaqqodayis beezooya. Iita baz ixxoytta; lo77o baz miinthii aykkoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Pettay pettayira woli ishegarkk dosinttoytta; pettay petta bonchchoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Oosor azallippate miinggoytta; yi ayyanar xuuginttii Godayis moodinttoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Xoossii inggeez ufayssayir ufayttoytta; meto danda7oytta; ubba wode Xoossa woossoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Ammaniza geeshshita koshshiza bazar maaddoytta; imathita mokkodayis miinggoytta.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Yinttan bayi7izita anjjoytta; anjjoyttapp attin baaddippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat. 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luq. 6:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Ufayttizitayir ufayttoytta; yeekkizitayir yeekkoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Pettay pettayir pettii qofar yezoytta. Utira qofa ashshii, haayotithar yezodayis miinggoytta. Yi yinttan eca gi qoppippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Aazi. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Oonkka yinttis iitta baz oothiko, ye athayis iita baz mahippate. Ubba as tiina sabbisiza lo77o ooso oothoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Yinttis danda7inttiko ubba asar saro yezoytta. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Ta ishuntho, yinttii, yi ubbas asis kushe kessippatte. Xoossii kushe kessoday garkke ezis ashii ashshoytta. Geesha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">«Ta kushe kessoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:19">taanii kushe mahoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Nam7i. 32:35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:19">yeegeeza Goday, ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Zin Geesha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">«Ne morkkay nayinttiko muzoba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">E saaminttiko ushshoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Ne yeya oothiko e ommayil</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">tama qaaqa kaachiza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Aazi. 25:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:20">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Iita lo77or gammoyttapp attin iitar gammippatte.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Gade aqisizitayis azazintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Aba mawutekka Xooss shener ingginttiza gishosinne yhatti mawuter yezitaykka Xooss shener mawute ekkeez gishos asii ubbay gade aqisizitayis azazinttodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Yey gishos, mawuter yezitayis kiitinttaam ixxiza oonkka Xooss kiita ixxiza. Kiitinttaam ixxiza oonkka faal afa pirdda ki7iza. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Aqisizitay iita baz oothizitapp attin lo77o oothizita yashisooya. Aqisizitayis yashttamayis koyinee? Yezako lo77o baz oothoba; nena galatoda. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Unttii nees lo77o baz oothodayis shuumintteez Xooss aylle. Zin neenii iita baz oothiko, unttii iita baz ootheezana seeriza gishos ezis yashittoba unttii qawa aykkeezay cere baaya. Unttii iita baz oothizita seerii, Xooss kaccizana beeziza Xooss aylle. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Yey gishos, Xooss kachch aaddas baazin yi kahay markkattiz gishos gade aqisizitayis kiitinttodayis beeziza.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Yi giira giirizaykka yey gishosii. Gade aqisizitay ye oosa oothizay, unttii Xooss ayllita maaqqeez gishshos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat. 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luq. 20:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Ubbayis beezizana inggoytta. Giira beezizitayis giiroytta; qaraxe beezizitayis qaraxe gachoytta; yashittodayis beezizitayis yashittooytta; bonchcho beezizana bonchchoytta.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woli qadhdhoytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Pettay pettayir siiqinttoytta. Siiqo acopp attin yinttal afa hara aco yezippe. As dosiza oonkka higgay gizana poleeza. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>«Laammippe; wodhippe; kasttippe; wordo markkatippe, amottippe» giz azazaynnee hara azazo ubbay, «Ne zhama ne ubbay garkk qadhdhoba» giz azazayir acintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Kes. 20:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Nam7i. 5:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewii. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Siiqo fa zhamayil afa iita baz oothooya. Yey gishos, siiqo higges folo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Genttapp yi barkkiza woday yhatti helleez maaqqeezayis layitha eroytta. Nu attotith woday tiin nu ammaneez wodepp aathii yhatt nuuko ukkeeza. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Qammay aadheeza; gallasay ukkeeza. Yikkee, nuunii dhuma ooso ashshii poo7o ola miishe wolla aykkoda. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>An gallas poo7o yez as garkk wolla maarar yezoda. Yeththarannee Mathera, laamerannee qayixera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wushshumar wolla duma duma tuna oositayir: woy yethar, mather, wushshumar, qayxer maaqqippe gi billodayis danda7inttiza. Wushshumar wollal duma duma tuna oositay asii Xooss modizaypp bale kezii do7a xabaye ekkii poliza ooso guussii.</char></note> palamarannee qinaatera maaqqippe. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosana ma77oytta; yi nagara oothiz ashay fa inna polod garkk ezis qoppippate.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Asal afa pirddipate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Ammanor daabureez oonakka shiishii ekkoyttapp attin e qofayil afa pirddippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Qol. 2:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Aazisos, ammanor minggeez pettii as aba kathakka maadayis danda7iza. Zin ammanor xaalekka as atakiltte aadda miiza. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Miiz as moowa atha borippe. Moowa as miiz athayil pirddippe. Xoossii ubbita ekkeeza. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Hara as ayllel afa pirddizay neenii oonoo? E daaburin woy minggin fa Godayisii. Goday eza essodayis danda7iza gishos E miinggii eqqoda.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Ma «Pettii gallasii yhankko gallasaypp aadhiza» yeegii qoppiza asii yeza. Haray ma, «Gallasitay ubbitay wol garkk gina bonchor yeza» gi qoppiza. Zin pettay pettay fa qofa akaakii acco. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Gallas bonchchiz oonkka Godayis gi bonchchiza. Ubba katha miiz asii Goday bonchchos gi miiza. E miiz ye kathat gishos Xoossa galatiza. Ubba katha moowa asii Goday bonchchos mooya; ma meekka ashorakka Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Nuupp oonkka paas baaya; ma nu ganccepp oonkka paas yhayqqaam. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nu shemppor yeziko Godayis yezoda; ma yhayqqikokka Godayis yhayqqoda. Yikkee, nu shemppor yezin woy yhayqqin Godayisii.<verse eid="ROM 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Kiristtoosa yhayqqii yhayiqopp denddeezay, de7or yezitayisinnee yhayqqeezitayis God maaaqadayisii. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Yeezin, neenii ne ishayil afa abis pirddee? Woy neenii ne isha abis leqqee? Nuunii ubbitay Xooss pirdda zufaane tiina eqqoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Qor. 5:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Taanii path yezaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">as ubbitay ta tiina bunqqitoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">taanii Xooss maaqqeezana inxaris ubbay markkattoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa. 45:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:11">yeegii xaafintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Yikkee, nu ootheez bazis nu ommar ommar Xooss tiina shiiqii mahith immada.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hara asis dhube maaqqippe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Yey gishos, nuunii pettay pettayil afa pirddiza wolla ashshoda. Zin yi isha dhubithiza woy qaxithiza baz oothaamay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Goda Yesuusa ammaniza asgarkk, fa ubbas tuna maaqqeez baz baazana taanii geeshshii eriza. Zin pettii asii pettibaz tuna gi qoppiko yey ezis tuna maaqqiza. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ne miiz katha gishos ne isha dhubbizabaz maaqqiko, Kiristtoosar yeza ne isha qadhdhooya. Kiristtoosa e gishos yhayqqeez atha ne miiz katha gishos eza dhabisppe. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Yikkee, yinttis yez lo77o baza yhankkitay borod garkke oothippate. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Xooss kaatetithay Geeshsha Ayyanayir benttiz xillotithi, sarotithinnee tuma ufayssapp attin muus baggannee ushsh bagga baaya. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Yey garkk Kiristtoosas moodinttiz as Xooss ufayssiza; asay ganccekka anjjinttiza.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Yey gishos, ane nuunii sarotithi benttiz ogennee woli ammanor miinthiza oge kaaliza. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Katha gishos gi Xoossa ooso dhabisppe. Ubba katha geeshshii, zin hara as se7isiza katha muusii iita. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ne ishay dhubinttaam garkk asho maam woy ushsh uzhaam woy dhubbiza hara baz oothaminxiko lo77o.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Yikkee, yha ne ammana neesinnee ne Xoossay gancce naagoba. Likke gi qoppeezbaz oothiza wode e kahay mootoowa athay anjjintteeza. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Zin sidhitar miiz athayis e muusay ammanor maaqqekka gishos pirddinttiza. Ammano bayith oothintteez ooso ubbitay nagara.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Hara asita ufaysso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Nu minthitay daabureezitay daabura tookkodayis beeziza. Nuunii nuna ufayssodayis beezooya. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Nuunii woli minthodayis zhamita maaddodayisnnee ufayssodayis beeziza. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kiristtoosa fana ufayssibe7ekkaya. Zin Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Asay nena cazheez cashshay tana helleeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz. 69:9</ref></char></note> ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk haneeza. <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay inggiza garzhorannee minthathora nu ufayssa ekkod garkk Geeshsha Maxaafayid xaafintteez ubbitay nuna tamaarssodayis xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Garzhonnee minotith inggiza Goday yinttii Yesuusa Kiristtoosa kaallodar pettepettith yinttis inggo. <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Yeykka, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Ada, Xoossa, pettii wozinarannee pettii qaalar yi bonchchod garkke.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wongilay as ubbitayis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Kiristtoosa yinttan ekkeezay garkk Xooss bonchchos pettay petta ekkoytta. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Xoossii binii aditayis inggeez ufayssay polinttod garkk e tumatithay erinttoday garkk Kiristtoosa dookalinttos aylle maaqqii ye7eezana ta yinttis odiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Kiristtoosa dookalinttos aylle maheez bazay ma Ayihude baa asay Xoossa e maarotithay gishos galatod garkke. Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Ta nena Ayihude baa as gancce galatoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">ne suntha sabboda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam. 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Maz. 18:49</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkk haneeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Ma, «Ayihude baa asayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Xooss woyayira ufayttoytta»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nam7i. 32:43</ref></char></note> yeegintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Ma mahii, «Ayihude baa asay ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Goda galatooytta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">kaatetithii ubbitay eza sabboytta»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Maz. 117:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:11">yeegintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Yey garkk Isiyaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Issaye xaphopp yelintteez pettay ye7oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">E fa kaatetithita ubbita aqisoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">U fa ufayssa ezalli afa gaddoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa. 11:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:12">yeegeeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar yi diccod garkk ufayss inggiz Xoossay, yi ammanay baggar yinttis ufayssara sarotithar kunthii inggo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ta ishuntho yintt lo77otithinne eretithii kumeezana ma pettay petta zorodayis danda7izana ta geeshshii eriza. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Taanii yinttan pettii pettibaz gujjii akaakisodayis koy yashittekkazar yha dabddaabba yinttis xaafeeza. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Taanii Kiristtoos Yesuusa aylle maaqqii, Ayihude maaqqekka asayis qeese garkk oothii, wongile odod garkke Xoossay taas aadho keehetithi inggeeza. Ayihude baa asay Geeshsha Ayyanar geezhii, Xooss ufayssiza yarshsho maaqqad garkk Xoossay yeya ootheeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Taanii Kiristtoos Yesuusar maaqqii Xoossis oothiza oosor ceeqinttiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ayihude baa asay Xoossayis kiittinttod, Kiristtoosa ta qaalannee ta ooso baggar ootheez oosaypp attin hara ta ceeqinttizabaz baaya. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Xooss yeya malatarannee Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar wayizii ootheezakko ta yinttis ododa. Taanii Yerusalamepp aykkii, Iliwarqoonnee hellodayis Kiristtoosa wongile sabbakeeza. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Taanii hara as baaseez aqayid keexxodayis koyooya. Kiristtoosa sunthay xeeginttekka aqo wongile sabbakodayis amottiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«E bagga odinttekka asay eza be7ada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">E bagga si7ekka asay akaakoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa. 52:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Oroome yhammadayis qoppeeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Yey baggar, taanii gaame wode yinttiko ye7odayis koyin danda7inttekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Oro. 1:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Zin taanii yhatte yha heerar yez aqo ubba helleez gishos gaame laythapp aykkii yinttan be7adayis laamoteez gishos <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>taanii Ispheenee yhanigitar yinttan be7adayis qoppeeza. Ma xiqqa wode yinttar ufaytteezaypp guye Ispheenee yhanigodar yi ta ogayis tana maaddod garkk koyiza.<verse eid="ROM 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Zin yhatte taanii Xoossa asita maaddodayis Yerusalaame yhanigiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Maqadoonarannee Akkaya yez Xooss asitay, Yerusalaame geeshshitay gancce yez manqqita miisher maaddodayis kozheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 Qor. 16:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Unttii manqqita maaddoday unttis attowa baz maaqqeez gishos fa ubbas yeya oothodayis qofa acceeza. Ayihuditay Ayihude baazitayira ayyana anjjo shaaginttiko, unttii ma paas yezabazar Ayihudita maaddodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 Qor. 9:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Yey gishos, taanii ye shiiqeez miisha unttisi inggezayppennee ekkeezana ereezapp guye Ispheenee yhanigitar yi lanqqer aadhoda. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Taanii yinttiko yhanigiza wode Kiristtoosa anjjo kunthar yhammadana ta eriza.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ta ishuntho, taasi Xooss woossittar ta butinttodar taar eqqod garkk Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosarannee Geeshsha Ayyana siiqayir yinttan woossiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Xoossay tana Yihuda gancce yez ammanoowa asitaypp ashshod garkkennee Yerusalaame ta oothod ooso Xooss asay lanqqe ekkinttod garkk taas woossoytta. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Ma Xooss giiko, taanii yinttiko yhanigii ufayisar yinttar shemppod garkk taasi woossoytta. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Sarotith Xoossay yinttar ubbayir maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kinkkira katama gancce yez woosa keetha oothiza nu mishshit Feebena lo77o maachch maaqqeezanno yi erod garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Yi izo ammaniza asitay Goday sunthar mokkodayis beeziza ammaniza asitaypp pettay garkk mokkoytta. Iza yinttapp koyiz baz ubbita izo maaddoytta. Iza fa ubbas gaame as maaddeeza; ma tana ta baggar undenna maaddeeza.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Kiristtoosa Yesuusa oosa taar wolla oothizi Phirisqilarannee Aqila ta qoodhe saro goytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Haw. O. 18:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Unttii ta gishos fa shemppo yhayiqos aathii inggeeza. Ta aadda baazin Ayihude baa asay woosa keethitay ubbitay unttan galatiza. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>U kara shiiqiz ammaniza asa ta qoodhe saro goytta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Iisiya biitta Kiristtoosana tiin ammaneezannee, ta qaadhiza Ephanexoosas ta sarotha odoytta.<verse eid="ROM 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Yi gishos oosor gaame daabureez Mayramo saro goytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Taar achch kara gam7eezita Ayihude dabbita Anddironiqoosara Yuuliyanar saro goytta. Unttii Yesuusa hawaaritay gancce erintteezita. Ma unttii Kiristtoosa taapp tiina ammaneeza.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Goda ammaniza ta siiqo lagga, Amphiliyaxoosa saro goytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Kiristtoosa oosa nuur wolla oothiz Urbbanoosera ta qadhdhiza Isttakusa saro goytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Kiristtoosar yessay markkattintteez Axelisas ta sarotha odoytta. Arsixabulo kara asayis ta sarotha odoytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ta Ayihude lagga Heroodiyoona saro goytta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Narssisara e kara asaypp Kiristtoosa ammaneezita saro goytta.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Goday oosor daaburiz maachchi Xirufaynaranne Xirufoosa saro goytta. Ma Godayis gaame daaburii oothiz, ta qadhdhiza Xersiso saro goytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Goday oosor loythii erintteez Rufoosasarannee tana fa na7a garkk bi7iza e indatis ta sarotha odoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar. 15:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asiqqirxxoosa, Filesonxxa, Hermmensa, Phatirobaasasira unttar yez ammaniza ishita ubbayis ta sarotha odoytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Filoloogusa, Yuuliya, Neera, e mishitto, Olumppoosara unttar yez geeshshita ubbita saro goytta.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Geeshsha yeera yeerinttittar, pettay petta sarothoytta. Kiristtoosa woosa keetha ubbitay yinttan saro yeegiza.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssithii zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ta ishuntho, yi tamaareez timirtta ixxii, yi gancce shaakinttonnee meto medhdhiz asitaypp naaginttoytta. Unttapp haakkoytta. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Yey garkk asay fa ulos oothizapp attin nu Goda Kiristtoosas oothooya. Fa liiqo doonarannee worddo qaalar haayo wozina balithiza. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Wonggilayis yi kiitintteezana as ubbitay si7eezay tana ufayssiza. Zin yi lo77o bazis eca iita bazis boozodana ta koyiza. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Saro Xoossay Xalahana yi tokaypp oommor elisii gaacoda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehetithay yinttar maaqqo.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Taar oothizi Ximaatoosa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Haw. O. 16:1</ref></char></note> ta dabbitay Luqiyoosa, Yaasonera Sosiphixiroosa yinttan saro yeegiza.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Yha dabddaabba xaafeezi taanii, Xarxiyoosa, yinttan Goday sunthar saro yeegiza.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Tana mokkeezaynnee woosa keeth ubbitay mokkiza Gaayoosa, yinttan saro geeza. Katama miishe aykkizi Erasxoosara nu isha Qarxoosa yinttan saro yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Haw. O. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Qor. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Xim. 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>[Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehetithay yi ubbayir maaqqo. Amin7e.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binii tiina maxaafitayid payido 24 baaya.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Haw. O. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Qor. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Xim. 4:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Xoossis galata maaqqo. Taanii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baz odiz wongile qaalayir bini wodepp ayikkii qosinttii gam7eez tumatithar, Xoossay yinttan ammanor miinthii essodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Zin yhatti ye tumay bentteeza. Kaatetithii ubbitay ammanii kiitinttoday garkk medhina Xoossa kiitar nabitay ye tumabaz xaafeeza.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar ecetithii e aaddas yeza, pettii Xoossayis medhinas bonchcho maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
